==Description==
The '''Immobilator''' is a gear item that is equipped in the torso slot. When activated (default {{Key|space}}), it will freeze the player's motion for a time. When deactivated, after a time or by pressing {{Key|space}}, the player will begin moving with the same velocity as they had before. Like other gear items, it will break after being used for a while. The item and schematic are [[Marauder]] items, meaning they can only be found in Marauder chests.
